A living organic spacecraft resembling a magnificent golden-brown leviathan glides through the swirling chaos of a cosmic wormhole, its bioluminescent hull pulsing with warm amber light. The vessel's elegant, whale-like curves contrast against the violent spiraling tunnel of deep purples, electric blues, and crackling energy surrounding it. Inside the translucent sections of the ship, silhouettes of diverse alien crew members can be glimpsed going about their duties. The wormhole's event horizon stretches and warps space itself, creating ribbons of distorted starlight that wrap around the ship like protective tendrils. Floating debris from distant galaxies drifts past—ancient asteroids, crystalline formations, and mysterious artifacts caught in the same cosmic current. The scene conveys found family, adventure into the unknown, and the beauty of unconventional homes among the stars. Rendered in dramatic cyberpunk style with neon accent lighting cutting through organic textures, high contrast shadows, and gritty atmospheric haze creating depth and mystery.
